				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;requirements&#34;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.musicpd.org/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;mpd&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA; &amp;amp; &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.musicpd.org/clients/mpc/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;mpc&lt;/a&gt; &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 12 16&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;16&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&#34;evenodd&#34; d=&#34;M11 10h1v3c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1V3c0-.55.45-1 1-1h3v1H1v10h10v-3zM6 2l2.25 2.25L5 7.5 6.5 9l3.25-3.25L12 8V2H6z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;a list of podcast RSS feed links&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;example-podcast-rss-feed-links&#34;&gt;Example podcast RSS feed links&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Here&amp;rsquo;s list of my favourite English &amp;amp; Polish podcasts in an &lt;a href=&#34;../files/podcasts.opml&#34;&gt;OPML&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;format.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You can extract RSS feed links from it with:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;awk -F &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;&amp;#34;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;{print $6}&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; podcasts.opml | sed &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;/^$/d&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;load-podcast-into-mpd&#34;&gt;Load podcast into MPD&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Given that you&amp;rsquo;ve saved your podcast feed list in &lt;code&gt;~/Music/podcasts.rss&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Then with a simple while loop you can load your podcast episodes into mpd.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
